  "descripcion_html": "<br><strong>Position Overview:</strong><p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 13.3333px;padding:0px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;font-style:italic;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">This is a vacancy for a hybrid role based at our coworking office in Paris (9th arrondissement, Opéra). We encourage applications from all qualified candidates, regardless of gender identity. You will be on-site in Paris 2 days per week for close collaboration and alignment; the remaining 3 days can be worked remotely.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 13.3333px;padding:0px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">We're a small, fast-moving French team backed by a German HQ. We need someone genuinely entrepreneurial who thrives on ownership rather than process, and who is both commercially sharp and technically curious – a strong communicator able to translate technical value into business outcomes.</span></span></p><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;background-color:rgb(198,198,198);font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Ready to make an impact?</span></span></span></p><br><strong>You’ll get to take ownership of:</strong><p><ul style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Full sales </span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">cycle:</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\"> owning qualification through close on the French market. Typical deals run €33–40k ACV, with occasional enterprise opportunities above €150k.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Net-new business in a lean setup: driving new-logo pipeline generation in a 3-person French sales team, where sourcing outside your own network matters as much as closing.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Partner-led scaling: building and activating the strategic partner ecosystem (Hardis, Horus, </span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Acelys</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">, CGI, </span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Devoteam</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">) as a lever for sourcing and co-selling – partner-sourced deals count at a 1.2× accelerator toward quota.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Technically credible selling: running discovery and value conversations around data integration, EDI and IT/SI architecture, engaging both business and technical stakeholders (IT, architecture, CISO).</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Cross-functional deal-shaping: working closely with Sales Engineering and Partnerships on complex, multi-stakeholder deals, RFPs and consortia.</span></span></li></ul></p><br><strong>We’d love to meet someone with:</strong><p><ul style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Proven track record: consistently closing software/SaaS deals with a documented win history – not just </span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">pipeline</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">New-logo generation: a track record of opening new business outside your own existing network, through mapping, partners, events or an installed base.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Technical affinity: strong understanding of data, integration and IT system architecture; able to hold your own in a technical discovery conversation.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Industry knowledge: domain exposure to logistics, supply chain, retail, manufacturing, automotive or pharma.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Scale-up selling: experience in a small / scale-up structure – high autonomy, hands-on, comfortable without heavy sales infrastructure.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Partner / channel selling: demonstrated success selling through or with strategic partners and system integrators (co-sell, ecosystem-led growth).</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Languages: French native or bilingual; professional/fluent English (internal working language; HQ in <span style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;border:0px rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0);display:inline;font-family:'WordVisi_MSFontService', 'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;font-size:13.3333px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;height:auto;line-height:18.6px;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-transform:none;width:auto;\">Germany).</span> </span></span></li></ul></p><br><strong>You can look forward to:</strong><p><ul style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">No closed territories – this is a meritocracy: the more you win, the more scope you get.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Uncapped variable compensation, with quotas designed to be achievable.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">An AI-equipped sales workflow, including deal coaching and prospecting support.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Direct access to the Head of France and to how decisions get made.</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">A coworking office in Paris (Opéra)</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">A personal learning and development budget</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">30 vacation days per year</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Up to 20 days of remote work per year from any EU country</span></span></li><li style=\"margin-left:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Opportunity to work flexibly from home</span></span></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 13.3333px;padding:0px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">If you're excited about this role but don't meet every qualification, we encourage you to apply!</span></span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;background-color:rgb(198,198,198);font-size:13px;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 13.3333px;padding:0px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;background-color:transparent;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-size:13px;font-style:italic;line-height:18.6px;font-family:'Times New Roman', 'Times New Roman_EmbeddedFont', 'Times New Roman_MSCustomFont', 'Times New Roman_MSFontService', serif;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Lobster is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive environment where empathy and respect guide our interactions.</span></span></p></p><p>Find more <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>",
